7.3 No other party may commercially exploit, resell, redistribute for payment, or offer an independent hosted or derivative service based on the Software without prior Written Authorization from the relevant Copyright Holder(s).

7.4 Ordinary use of an Official Pancake Service, or use of content generated through a service, does not by itself constitute Commercial Exploitation of the Software. This does not authorize copying protected source code or materials embedded in generated output.

